; Audited against data/effects.txt TEXT, lines 1458-1489; corrected locally.
; Castle must be a face-up monster on either field; Pumpking must be face-up.
; State ABI: 143/144 = this Pumpking modifier handles; 145 = gains (0..4);
; 246 = last Standby activation turn + 1. Initialize these fields to zero.
; The turn stamp survives Castle loss, preserving once-per-turn activation.
; Reevaluate continuous effects on state changes, including before resolution.
; Programs 1/3 refresh only this instance; loss of either condition clears gains.

; Pumpking the King of Ghosts: effect 1 (CONTINUOUS, optional=0)
.program 29155212_1
PC Instruction Meaning
