   13 AT A3, V3, V5                                                               
   14 ALU V5, V5, #1, ADD                                                         
   15 ATTRIBUTE A2, A3, #3                                                        
   16 LOAD V2, A2                                                                 
   17 COMPARE F0, V2, #1, EQUAL                                                   
   18 JUMPIF F0, 11, FALSE                                                        
   19 ATTRIBUTE A2, A3, #4                                                        
   20 LOAD V2, A2                                                                 
   21 COMPARE F0, V2, #1, EQUAL                                                   
